    <!-- Section 1 -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 font-serif-brand border-b border-stone-100 pb-2">1. Overview of Returns &amp; Exchanges</h2>
      <p>
        This Refund and Returns Policy applies to all purchases made online via our website (<%= request.host_with_port %>), via phone orders, or in person at our drive-thru collection facility operated by <strong>Muchea Trading Pty Ltd</strong> trading as <strong>Muchea Stockfeed &amp; Hardware</strong> ("we", "us", "our").
      </p>
      <p>
        Registered Business Address: <strong>17b Edwards Pl, Muchea WA 6501</strong><br>
        ABN: <strong>56 700 841 550</strong> | ACN: <strong>700 841 550</strong><br>
        Contact Telephone: <strong>(08) 9571 8840</strong> | Email: <strong>sales@mucheastockfeed.com.au</strong>
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 2 -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 font-serif-brand border-b border-stone-100 pb-2">2. Damaged, Defective, or Contaminated Stockfeed &amp; Goods</h2>
      <p>
        We inspect all feed bags, hay rolls, and hardware prior to warehouse loading and truck dispatch. However, if any product you receive:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 pl-2 text-stone-600">
        <li>Arrives damaged, punctured, torn, or wet due to transport conditions;</li>
        <li>Contains manufacturing defects, weevil/pest contamination, or expired feed batches;</li>
        <li>Does not match the ordered brand, size, or formulation (e.g. incorrect horse feed pellet delivered);</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Please notify our team within <strong>48 hours of delivery or pickup</strong> with your order number and photo evidence. We will arrange an immediate <strong>free replacement on our next scheduled truck run, or issue a 100% full refund</strong> including any delivery charges paid.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 3 -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 font-serif-brand border-b border-stone-100 pb-2">3. Change of Mind Returns (14 Days)</h2>
      <p>
        For non-defective stockfeed, pet food, and rural hardware, we offer exchanges or store credit within <strong>14 calendar days</strong> of purchase, provided that:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 pl-2 text-stone-600">
        <li>Bags of feed, supplements, and pet food are unopened, untampered, dry, and in resaleable condition;</li>
        <li>Fencing wire, poly fittings, tools, and hardware are unused in original packaging;</li>
        <li>Proof of purchase (Tax Invoice or Order Confirmation) is presented.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-stone-500 text-xs italic">
        Note: Due to biosecurity and moisture considerations, open bags of grain, feed, or unpacked hay rolls cannot be returned for change of mind.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 4 -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 font-serif-brand border-b border-stone-100 pb-2">4. Order Cancellations</h2>
      <p>
        If you wish to cancel an online order before it has been dispatched on our truck or packed for drive-thru collection, please call our warehouse at <strong>(08) 9571 8840</strong> as soon as possible. Unshipped orders will be cancelled immediately and refunded in full.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 5 -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 font-serif-brand border-b border-stone-100 pb-2">5. How Refunds Are Processed (Stripe)</h2>
      <p>
        All refunds approved under this policy are credited directly back to the <strong>original payment method</strong> used during checkout (via our secure payment processor, Stripe).
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 pl-2 text-stone-600">
        <li><strong>Processing Time:</strong> Once initiated by our team, refunds typically appear on your credit card, debit card, or bank statement within <strong>3 to 5 business days</strong> depending on your financial institution.</li>
        <li><strong>Currency:</strong> All refunds are issued in <strong>Australian Dollars (AUD)</strong> and include the original 10% Australian GST component.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

